(text "Module + adapter are one removable soldered assembly. Only original14 full holes pass through XIAO." (at 25 121 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "1d493efd-e613-432b-ac49-c05b3d0a84b0"))
(text "J2 is the existing motherboard mating interface (off-board). U1 compound footprint includes its 14 physical pins." (at 25 124.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "bd5c099a-9935-447e-851c-96a13057dc17"))
(text "J1 contacts1..9 = S3 D11..D19; RP1..8=D11..D18, RP9=3V3_RP. Contact10=GND." (at 25 128 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "7fa69373-d872-45d8-9830-3441d72de82d"))
(text "0.8mm adapter, approximately11.04mm PCB-to-adapter spacing; raises XIAO body0.8mm." (at 25 135 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "9cd1ba9f-3694-4f9e-b91f-fed3623b3624"))
(text "S3 J3 top B2B signals excluded here and require separate top breakout. GPIO21 stays USER_LED." (at 25 142 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "a077773b-2028-4869-a780-4c25060ad4bc"))
(text "FW configured MPN: supplier availability and sample mating/tolerances not qualified. NOT fabrication release." (at 25 149 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "70c9f24c-866b-4266-9f1b-ff4d5e1aa544"))
